-- v10 -> v11: work a reviewer has handed back, with the reason (item 6).
--
-- Migrated, never recreated, for the reason 7.sqm gives: a device in the field
-- carries its op log and its logical counter across upgrades, and operation
-- nonces are derived from (deviceId, counter) (envelope §4.5).
--
-- The reason travels with the work and is stored beside it. A rejection whose
-- reason stopped at the server is not delivered — the enumerator opens the
-- same household with nothing to change and repeats the visit.
--
-- `returned_at` is when the DECISION was made, not when this device heard
-- about it: the statement carries the decision's own timestamp, and a device
-- that has been offline for a week must not report the news as fresh. Same
-- reasoning as `reported_at` on the server's device row (015).

ALTER TABLE submission ADD COLUMN returned_reason TEXT;
ALTER TABLE submission ADD COLUMN returned_at TEXT;
ALTER TABLE submission ADD COLUMN returned_by TEXT;
